/fixtures/local/
/tmp/
*.local.json

# Price books are fetched at runtime into the user data dir, never shipped.
/crates/tokenstat-core/pricing/

# Internal working notes. Research, design rationale, and session handover.
# Not published: these reference local paths and machine specifics.
/roadmap.md
/WORKLOG.md
# Task tracking with local machine details. Same rule as WORKLOG.md: internal.
/TODO.md
# The whole docs directory is internal: design notes, build plans, work
# handovers and licensing rationale are ours, not the repo's. What the public
# needs is README.md, LICENSE and TRADEMARK.md.
/docs/

# Coverage and profiling
/coverage/
lcov.info
*.profraw
*.profdata
flamegraph.svg
perf.data*

# Editors and tooling
.vscode/
